    {
      "id": "note-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 895,
      "width": 1640,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "1. \"IMPROVE NOW\" BUTTONS: Changed from passive \"Needs review\" to action-oriented \"Improve now\" (blue, prominent)\n   - Consistent blue styling matches Story/Point accent colors\n   - Clear call-to-action language\n\n2. AVATARS ON ALL STORY CARDS: Added avatar circle to Story card in individual review (screen 4)\n   - Dashboard: Story has avatar ✓\n   - Individual review: Story has avatar ✓ (NEW)\n   - Points: NO avatars anywhere ✓\n\n3. UPDATED PUBLISH BUTTON: \"Skip reviews and publish as-is\" with \"or\" divider\n   - Clearer that this skips the review process\n   - Gray/muted styling (not primary action)\n   - Placed below \"Improve now\" buttons\n\n4. BUTTON CONSISTENCY CHECK:\n   - Dashboard \"Improve now\" = Blue, solid, action CTA\n   - Review \"Continue →\" = Blue, action CTA (fixed per design system)\n   - Publish \"Publish →\" = Green, final success action\n\nShowing screens 1-4. Screens 5-7 (Point reviews, Publish) follow same patterns from V6.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid"
    }
